WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.160
On "The Big Bang Theory," Penny has&nbsp;
occasionally shared tidbits about her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.520
quirky family from Omaha, Nebraska, but only a few&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.240
appeared during the show's 12-season run&nbsp;
— most notably Wyatt, Penny's father.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.080
Along with having a brother, Randall, who&nbsp;
is best known for his history cooking meth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.400
Penny mentions having a sister a few times&nbsp;
in the show — the sister who drunkenly shot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.560
her own husband, and gave Penny her&nbsp;
first bikini wax using melted crayons.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.280
While Penny's brother, dad, and mom Susan&nbsp;
all attend Penny and Leonard's second wedding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.680
ceremony in the first episode of Season&nbsp;
10, her sister is nowhere to be seen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:39.040
and is never even mentioned — a pretty big plot&nbsp;
hole, if you ask us. In Season 12, however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.280
we at least finally learn Penny's&nbsp;
mysterious sister's name: Lisa.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.120
"Being your dad is the best&nbsp;
thing that ever happened to me."

00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:48.633
"What about Randall and Lisa?"

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.160
"They’re okay."

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:52.673
*Laughter*

